[67.932, "o", "---\r\nadr: \"docs/decisions/ADR-XXXX.md\"\r\nstatus: proposed\r\n---\r\n# Review Spec Interaction\r\n\r\n## Why\r\n\r\nSee the linked ADR for the decision rationale. This proposal records the change in scope.\r\n\r\n## What Changes\r\n\r\n- Add the ReviewSpec skill at `runes/core/skills/ReviewSpec/SKILL.md`, promoted from a `rune draft`.\r\n- Name compatibility or migration effects.\r\n\r\n## Capabilities\r\n\r\n- review-spec-interaction (new or modified)\r\n\r\n## Impact\r\n\r\n- `runes/core/skills/ReviewSpec/SKILL.md` (new).\r\n"]
